$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Method B. Dess-Martin Oxidation A soln of
alcohol 23 (3.71 g 10.0 mmol), 25 (4.47 g, 10.0 mmol), 31 (4.57 g, 10.0
mmol), or 32 (5.33 g, 10.0 mmol) in anhyd CH2Cl2 (20 mL) was added
dropwise to a stirred soln of 12-I-5-triacetoxyperiodinane (10.60 g, 25.0
mmol), solid NaHCO3 (1.6 g), and molecular sieves (4 Å, 15 g) in anhyd
CH2Cl2 (400 mL) at 0 °C under an Ar atmosphere. After stirring for 4 h at
r.t. (reaction monitored by TLC), solids were filtered off, and the
filtrate was concentrated. The residue was purified by flash
chromatography to provide the ethynyl ketones 27,29,33, and 34.
1-(5-O-tert-Butyldimethylsilyl-2,3-O-isopropylidene-1-deoxy-β-D-ribofuranos-1-yl)pent-4-yn-3-one
(27) Method B. Purified by flash chromatography (solvent A8).
1-[3,5-O-(Tetraisopropyldisiloxane-1,3-diyl)-1,2-dideoxy-β-D-ribofuranos-1-yl]pent-4-yn-3-one
(33) Method B. Reaction time 1 h; purified by flash chromatography
(solvent A7).
1-[3,5-O-(Tetraisopropyldisiloxane-1,3-diyl)-1,2-dideoxy-β-D-ribofuranos-1-yl]pent-4-yn-3-one
(33), Yield: 3.5 g {11%); colorless syrup [a]D24 -26.5 (c 1.0, CH2Cl2);
Rf= 0.47 (solvent A6). 1H NMR (250.13 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 0.98-1.09 [m, 28
H, CH(CH3)2], 1.72-2.09 (m, 4 H, H-1,2'), 2.71 (m, 2 H, H-2), 3.21 (s, 1
H, H-5), 3.65-3.76 (m, 2 H, H-4',5'a), 3.95-4.16 (m, 2 H,
H-1',5'b),4.36(app dt,3J2'a,3' ≈ 3J3',4' = 7.9 Hz, 3J2'b,3' = 4.5 Hz, 1
H, H-3'). 13C NMR (62.9 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 12.5, 12.9, 13.3, 13.5
[CH(CH3)2], 16.9, 17.0,17.1,17.3,17.4(2), 17.4,17.5 [CH(CH3)2], 29.2
(C-1), 40.2 (C-2'), 41.8 (C-2), 63.7 (C-5'), 73.5 (C-3'), 76.2 (C-1'),
78.5 (C-5), 81.3 (C-4), 86.0 (C-4'), 186.6 (C-3). Anal. Calcd For
C23H42O5Si2 (454.75): C, 60.75; H, 9.31. Found: C, 60.38; H, 9.24.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM key intermediate for the synthesis of heterocyclic systems, Dess-Martin
oxidation, molecular sieves used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A versatile approach to alcohol, aldehyde, ketone and amine derivatives
starting from β-allyl C-glycosides of D-ribofuranose and
2-deoxy-D-ribofuranose
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Waechtler, Heike; Fuentes, Dilver Pena; Michalik, Dirk; Koeckerling,
