$DATUM In light of the transition metal connection, it is noteworthy that use of
the Swern DMSO-oxalyl chloride 12 reagent afforded a Copound. Substrate:
5b; Ratio 6b: 1; Overall yield: 75%. 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ = 9.62 (s, 1 H),
7.2-7.6 (m, 5 H), 5.50 (s, 1 H), 4.1-4.3 (m, 2 H), 3.75-3.85 (m, 1 H),
1.6-2.0 (m, 2 H) ppm. 13C NMR (CDCl3): δ = 200.68, 138.52, 129.69, 128.86
(2 C), 126.77 (2 C), 101.63, 80.88, 66.94, 26.40. GC-MS: 192 (M).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
